340 + 4890:.\n\n29,340.\n\n+  4,890.\n\n= ?.\n\n29,340 + 4,000 = 33,340.\n\n33,340 + 890 = 34,230. Yes, so that's 34,230.\n\nNow add that to the third partial product: 34,230 + 391,200.\n\n34,230 + 391,200.\n\nLet me add them:.\n\n34,230.\n\n+391,200. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
