\n   \\]\n   Partial product: 514800 (shifted two positions to the left)\n\n4. **Add all the partial products:**\n   \\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n     \\quad 3432 \\\\\n   + 17160 \\\\\n   +514800 \\\\\n   \\hline\n     535392 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n\n   - Adding the first two partial products:\n     \\[\n     3432 + 17160 = 20592\n     \\]\n   - Adding the result to the third partial product:\n     \\[\n     20592 + 514800 = 535392\n     \\]\n\nThus, the product of 858 and 624 is \\(\\boxed{535392}\\).",
