78400's ten thousands place).\nTotal:0 +2 +7 =9.\n\nHundred thousands place:.\n\nFirst number:0.\nSecond number:0.\nThird number:2 (from 278400's hundred thousands place).\nTotal: 2.\n\nPutting it all together:.\n\nHundred thousands:2, Ten thousands:9, Thousands:9, Hundreds:6, Tens:2, Units:8. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
