d the result to \\(285600\\):\n     \\[\n     61880 + 285600 = 347480\n     \\]\n\nTo verify, we can use alternative methods such as breaking down the multiplication:\n- **Using distributive property:**\n  \\[\n  952 \\times 365 = 952 \\times (300 + 60 + 5) = 952 \\times 300 + 952 \\times 60 + 952 \\times 5\n  \\]\n  \\[\n  = 285600 + 57120 + 4760 = 347480\n  \\]\n\n- **Alternative verification using subtraction:**\n  \\[\n  952 \\times 365 = 952 \\times (400 - 35) = 952 \\times 400 - 952 \\times 35\n  \\]\n  \\[\n  = 380800 - 33320 = 347480\n  \\]\n\nAll methods confirm that the product of 952 and 365 is \\(\\boxed{347480}\\).",
