\\[\n   \\begin{array}{r}\n     447 \\\\\n   +10430 \\\\\n   +14900 \\\\\n   \\hline\n     25777 \\\\\n   \\end{array}\n   \\]\n   - \\(447 + 10430 = 10877\\)\n   - \\(10877 + 14900 = 25777\\)\n\nVerification using the difference of squares method:\n- \\(149 \\times 173 = (161 - 12)(161 + 12) = 161^2 - 12^2\\)\n- \\(161^2 = 25921\\)\n- \\(12^2 = 144\\)\n- \\(25921 - 144 = 25777\\)\n\nThus, the product of 149 and 173 is \\(\\boxed{25777}\\).",
