 900\u00d7238 +1\u00d7238.\n\nCompute 900 \u00d7238 first. 900\u00d7200=180,000; 900\u00d738= 900\u00d730=27,000; 900\u00d78=7,200. So 27,000+7,200=34,200. So total 180,000+34,200=214,200. Then add 1\u00d7238=238. So total is 214,200 +238 = 214,438. Same result. Great, so that confirms it.\n\nTherefore, I think the correct answer is 214,438.\n\n**Final Answer**\nThe product of 901 and 238 is \\boxed{214438}.\n</think>\n\nTo find the product of 901 and 238, we use the standard multiplication algorithm:\n\n1. **Multiply 901 by 8 (units place of 238):**\n   \\[\n   901 \\times 8 = 7208\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 901 by 30 (tens place of 238):**\n   \\[\n   901 \\times 30 = 27030\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 901 by 200 (hundreds place of 238):**\n   \\[\n   901 \\times 200 = 180200\n   \\]\n\n4. **Add the partial products together:**\n   \\[\n   7208 + 27030 + 180200\n   \\]\n\n   - First, add \\(7208\\) and \\(27030\\):\n     \\[\n     7208 + 27030 = 34238\n     \\]\n   - Then add the result to \\(180200\\):\n     \\[\n     34238 + 180200 = 214438\n     \\]\n\nThus, the product of 901 and 238 is \\(\\boxed{214438}\\).",
