ogether:\n\n\\[\n900000 - 2000 - 9000 + 20 = 900000 - 2000 = 898000\n\\]\n\\[\n898000 - 9000 = 889000\n\\]\n\\[\n889000 + 20 = 889020\n\\]\n\nThus, the product of 990 and 898 is \\(\\boxed{889020}\\).",
