(hundred thousands), 1 (ten thousands), 7 (thousands), 6 (hundreds), 0 (tens), 0 (units).\n\nSo aligning:.\n\n   26,996.\n\n+317,600.\n\n----------.\n\nAdding:.\n\nStarting from the right:.\n\nUnits:6 +0=6.\n\nTens:9 +0=9.\n\nHundreds:9 +6=15. Write 5, carryover 1.\n\nThousands:6 +7=13 plus 1 is 14. Write 4, carryover 1.\n\nTen-thousands:2 +1=3 plus 1=4. Write 4, carryover 0.\n\nHundred thousands: 3. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
