700 &= 625704\n  \\end{align*}\n  \\]\n\n- **Breaking down into smaller parts:**\n  \\[\n  (700 + 44) \\times (800 + 41) = 560000 + 28700 + 35200 + 1804 = 625704\n  \\]\n\nAll methods confirm the result is consistent. Therefore, the product of 744 and 841 is \\(\\boxed{625704}\\).",
