s place: \\(3 + 0 + 0 = 3\\)\n- Tens place: \\(8 + 4 + 0 = 12\\) (write 2, carry over 1)\n- Hundreds place: \\(0 + 4 + 7 + 1 = 12\\) (write 2, carry over 1)\n- Thousands place: \\(1 + 4 + 2 + 1 = 8\\)\n- Ten thousands place: \\(0 + 1 + 5 = 6\\)\n- Hundred thousands place: \\(0 + 0 + 2 = 2\\)\n\nThus, the product of 361 and 743 is \\(\\boxed{268223}\\).",
