rtial products:**\n   \\[\n   \\begin{align*}\n   4739 + 27080 + 406200 &= 4739 + 27080 \\\\\n   &= 31819 \\\\\n   31819 + 406200 &= 438019 \\\\\n   \\end{align*}\n   \\]\n\nThus, the product of 677 and 647 is \\boxed{438019}.",
