n   (a - 1)(a + 1) = a^2 - 1^2\n   \\]\n\n3. **Calculate \\(a^2\\)**:\n   - Expand \\(652^2\\) using \\((650 + 2)^2\\):\n   \\[\n   (650 + 2)^2 = 650^2 + 2 \\cdot 650 \\cdot 2 + 2^2 = 422,500 + 2,600 + 4 = 425,104\n   \\]\n\n4. **Subtract 1**:\n   \\[\n   652^2 - 1 = 425,104 - 1 = 425,103\n   \\]\n\n**Verification via direct multiplication**:\n- \\(651 \\times 653 = 651 \\times (600 + 50 + 3)\\):\n  - \\(651 \\times 600 = 390,600\\)\n  - \\(651 \\times 50 = 32,550\\)\n  - \\(651 \\times 3 = 1,953\\)\n  - Sum: \\(390,600 + 32,550 + 1,953 = 425,103\\)\n\n**Final Answer**:  \n\\boxed{425103}",
