is 198,600.\n\nSo:.\n\n\xa0\xa0\xa0\xa037,072  .\n+198,600  .\n=--------.\n\nStarting from the right:.\n\nUnits: 2 + 0 = 2  .\nTens: 7 + 0 = 7  .\nHundreds: 0 + 6 =6  .\nThousands:7 (from 37,072's thousands place) + 8 (from 198,600's thousands place) =15. So write 5, carryover 1.  .\nTen-thousands: 3 (from 37,072) + 9 (from 198,600) + 1 (carryover) =13. Write 3, carryover 1.  .\nHundred-thousands: 0 (from 37,072) +1 (from 198,600) +1 (carryover) =2. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
