then ten thousands: 6. So total is 67915?.\n\nWait, let me check again:.\n\nWait 3995 plus 63,920:.\n\n3995 + 63,920 = 63,920 + 3,000 = 66,920; 66,920 + 995 = 67,915. Yes, that's correct.\n\nNow add 479,400 to that 67,915:.\n\n67,915 + 479,400. Let's see:.\n\n479,400 + 60,000 = 539,400. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
