ach part separately:\n1. \\(440 \\times 700\\):\n   \\[\n   440 \\times 700 = 440 \\times 7 \\times 100 = (400 \\times 7 + 40 \\times 7) \\times 100 = (2800 + 280) \\times 100 = 3080 \\times 100 = 308000\n   \\]\n\n2. \\(440 \\times 14\\):\n   \\[\n   440 \\times 14 = 440 \\times (10 + 4) = 440 \\times 10 + 440 \\times 4 = 4400 + 1760 = 6160\n   \\]\n\nAdding the results of the two parts:\n\\[\n308000 + 6160 = 314160\n\\]\n\nBoth methods confirm that the product of 440 and 714 is \\(\\boxed{314160}\\).",
