tract \\(866 \\times 1\\)**:\n   \\[\n   147220 - 866 = 146354\n   \\]\n\n4. **Verification using another method**:\n   - Break down the multiplication into parts:\n     \\[\n     866 \\times 169 = 866 \\times (100 + 60 + 9)\n     \\]\n     \\[\n     866 \\times 100 = 86600, \\quad 866 \\times 60 = 51960, \\quad 866 \\times 9 = 7794\n     \\]\n     \\[\n     86600 + 51960 + 7794 = 146354\n     \\]\n\nBoth methods confirm that the product of 866 and 169 is \\(\\boxed{146354}\\).",
