ne place to the left)} \\quad 12320\n   \\]\n   Result: 12320\n\n3. **Multiply 616 by 500 (hundreds place):**\n   \\[\n   616 \\times 5 = 3080 \\quad \\text{(then shift two places to the left)} \\quad 308000\n   \\]\n   Result: 308000\n\n4. **Add all the partial products:**\n   \\[\n   1848 + 12320 + 308000\n   \\]\n   - First, add 1848 and 12320:\n     \\[\n     1848 + 12320 = 14168\n     \\]\n   - Then add the result to 308000:\n     \\[\n     14168 + 308000 = 322168\n     \\]\n\nThus, the product of 616 and 523 is \\(\\boxed{322168}\\).",
