00 = 33,804.\n\nThen add that to 563,400:.\n\n33,804 + 563,400 = ?.\n\nLet me compute that. 33,804 + 563,400. Adding the thousands:.\n\n33,804 + 563,400 = (33,000 + 804) + (563,000 + 400) = 33,000 + 563,000 = 596,000; 804 + 400 = 1,204. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
