al products together:**\n   \\[\n   \\begin{align}\n   3708 + 4120 + 329600 &= (3708 + 4120) + 329600 \\\\\n   &= 7828 + 329600 \\\\\n   &= 337428\n   \\end{align}\n   \\]\n\nThus, the product of 412 and 819 is \\(\\boxed{337428}\\).",
