  \\]\n3. Multiply the result by 100:\n   \\[\n   6328 \\times 100 = 632800\n   \\]\n\nVerification using the distributive property and approximation confirms the result. \n\nThe product of 904 and 700 is \\(\\boxed{632800}\\).",
