tial products together:**\n   \\[\n   4683 + 33450 + 468300\n   \\]\n   - Step-by-step addition:\n     - Add \\(4683\\) and \\(33450\\):\n       \\[\n       4683 + 33450 = 38133\n       \\]\n     - Add the result to \\(468300\\):\n       \\[\n       38133 + 468300 = 506433\n       \\]\n\nThus, the product of 669 and 757 is \\(\\boxed{506433}\\).",
